# Only the staging directory prepared by prepare.sh and the documentserver-flush-cache.sh
# wrapper, which the image installs into /usr/local/bin, enter the build context.
# Everything else (the scripts themselves, the Dockerfile, stray files in the directory) is excluded,
# so the context size is predictable and does not depend on the contents of the fork directory.
*
!context
!documentserver-flush-cache.sh
